WorkspaceTemplateServiceImpl ..> WorkspaceRepository : uses
WorkspaceTemplateServiceImpl ..> UserSystemRoleRepository : uses

WorkspaceAccessService ..> WorkspaceMemberRepository : uses
WorkspaceAccessService ..> ClientProfileRepository : uses
WorkspaceAccessService ..> UserRepository : uses

' Repository -> Entity (Dependency)
AgencyRepository ..> Agency : manages
AgencyMemberRepository ..> AgencyMember : manages
AgencyInvitationRepository ..> AgencyInvitation : manages
WorkspaceRepository ..> Workspace : manages
WorkspaceMemberRepository ..> WorkspaceMember : manages
WorkspaceInvitationRepository ..> WorkspaceInvitation : manages
WorkspaceTemplateRepository ..> WorkspaceTemplate : manages
WorkspaceMediaPackageRepository ..> WorkspaceMediaPackage : manages

' Entity Associations & Compositions
Agency "1" *-- "0..*" AgencyMember : has members
Agency "1" *-- "0..*" AgencyInvitation : issues invitations
Agency "1" *-- "0..*" Workspace : organizes workspaces
Agency "1" o-- "0..*" WorkspaceTemplate : owns templates

Workspace "1" *-- "0..*" WorkspaceMember : has members
Workspace "1" *-- "0..*" WorkspaceInvitation : issues invitations
Workspace "1" *-- "0..1" WorkspaceMediaPackage : packages

Agency --> AgencyCategory : category
Agency --> CompanySize : companySize
Agency --> EntityStatus : status
AgencyMember --> AgencyMemberRole : role
AgencyInvitation --> InvitationStatus : status
AgencyInvitation --> MemberRole : role

Workspace --> WorkspaceIndustry : industry
Workspace --> CompanySize : companySize
Workspace --> EntityStatus : status
WorkspaceMember --> MemberRole : role
WorkspaceInvitation --> InvitationStatus : status
WorkspaceInvitation --> MemberRole : role
WorkspaceMediaPackage --> PackageNegotiationStatus : negotiationStatus

' DTO Usage (Dependency)
AgencyController ..> AgencyRequest : consumes
AgencyController ..> InviteAgencyMemberRequest : consumes
AgencyController ..> AcceptInvitationRequest : consumes
AgencyController ..> DeclineInvitationRequest : consumes
AgencyController ..> AgencyResponse : returns
AgencyController ..> AgencyMemberResponse : returns
AgencyController ..> AgencyInvitationResponse : returns
AgencyController ..> AgencyStatsResponse : returns
AgencyController ..> AgencyMemberProfileResponse : returns
AgencyController ..> InviteLookupResponse : returns
AgencyController ..> InvitationPreviewResponse : returns

WorkspaceController ..> CreateWorkspaceRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> UpdateWorkspaceSettingsRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> InviteMemberRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> AssignWorkspaceMembersRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> AddWorkspaceClientRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> UpdateMemberRoleRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> AcceptInvitationRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> DeclineInvitationRequest : consumes
WorkspaceController ..> WorkspaceResponse : returns
WorkspaceController ..> WorkspaceMemberResponse : returns
WorkspaceController ..> ManagedWorkspaceResponse : returns
WorkspaceController ..> WorkspaceDashboardResponse : returns
